        "meaning_cn": "代表某人/机构；为了某人的利益或支持",
        "definition_en": "representing someone or acting for their benefit or support",
        "boundary": "US English may also use 'in behalf of'. The representation-vs-benefit distinction is contextual, not an absolute on/in rule.",
