    "core_concept": {
      "core_clusters": [],
      "core_meaning_cn": "表示“替某人这一方行事”：既可代表某人/机构，也可为了某人的利益或支持；on behalf of 是主流形式，in behalf of 在美式可见",
      "core_meaning_en": "acting for someone's side: representing them or acting for their benefit/support; 'on behalf of' is standard, with 'in behalf of' also found in American English",
      "mental_model_cn": "on behalf of sb → 可表示代表，也可表示为了其利益/支持；不要硬拆成两个绝对不同短语。in behalf of 是美式可见变体。",
      "mental_model_en": "Use context to distinguish representation from benefit/support rather than relying on a rigid preposition rule."
    },
